### Product Information Aggregator — sample requests

@host = http://localhost:8080
@product = PROD-001

### Full response (NL market + customer)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products/{{product}}?market=nl-NL&customerId=CUST-42
Accept: application/json

### Poland, no personalization
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products/{{product}}?market=pl-PL
Accept: application/json

### Germany, second product
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products/PROD-002?market=de-DE&customerId=CUST-7
Accept: application/json

### 400 — invalid market format (on purpose)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products/{{product}}?market=invalid
Accept: application/json

### Swagger UI (OpenAPI + Try it out)
# Browser: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

### Actuator health (if exposed)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json
